(2288944, 313680, 33560, '<td valign="top">Fresnel on the beach.  Nice, but I''m wishing there were a lot less people - maybe none.  Or that there were one who was much closer...  Still, it''s a fun object to photograph.</td>', 'Fresnel on the beach.  Nice, but I''m wishing there were a lot less people - maybe none.  Or that there were one who was much closer...  Still, it''s a fun object to photograph.', '2006-04-05 08:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288949, 316573, 33560, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of a sort of refracted still life. And I like the choice of subjects.  I find the composition and lighting not to be quite so compelling.</td>', 'I really like the idea of a sort of refracted still life. And I like the choice of subjects.  I find the composition and lighting not to be quite so compelling.', '2006-04-05 08:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
