(2288958, 316757, 33560, '<td valign="top">Or zebra in a wine glass.  Clever and generally attractive.</td>', 'Or zebra in a wine glass.  Clever and generally attractive.', '2006-04-05 08:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288972, 316513, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s an almost invisible mirage. <br/> <br/>There is something about the almost total emptiness of this photo that just about makes it interesting.  I wonder if it would be more impactful with the saturation of the grass turned down.  (And once again I wish basic editing rules let us clone out distracting spots.... )</td>', 'It''s an almost invisible mirage.  There is something about the almost total emptiness of this photo that just about makes it interesting.  I wonder if it would be more impactful with the saturation of the grass turned down.  (And once again I wish basic editing rules let us clone out distracting spots.... )', '2006-04-05 08:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
