(2291373, 314370, 26679, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture of the Sun. When I was on Lantau earlier this year the sun was hidden behind clouds all the time..<br/> <br/>I like the concept here and I feel that cropping so that the sun is more off centre (rule of thirds) would give a more dynamic feel to this shot.</td>', 'Interesting capture of the Sun. When I was on Lantau earlier this year the sun was hidden behind clouds all the time.. I like the concept here and I feel that cropping so that the sun is more off centre (rule of thirds) would give a more dynamic feel to this shot.', '2006-04-06 04:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2291380, 313548, 26679, '<td valign="top">I love this set up. You have created a lovely water colour feel refraction, using colours which for me really work here. My gripe would be that I wish the vase/glass were more upright. A slight rotation Anti Clockwise would correct that.</td>', 'I love this set up. You have created a lovely water colour feel refraction, using colours which for me really work here. My gripe would be that I wish the vase/glass were more upright. A slight rotation Anti Clockwise would correct that.', '2006-04-06 04:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2291386, 315018, 44611, '<td valign="top">Perfect refraction - and a great shot.  I only wish the background was a different colour - it is too distracting.</td>', 'Perfect refraction - and a great shot.  I only wish the background was a different colour - it is too distracting.', '2006-04-06 04:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2291387, 314100, 26679, '<td valign="top">The effect with the glass and the vase on the right hand side works really well. I am not sure about the inverted glass on the left. For me compositionally it does not seem to add anything to this shot. I accept that it does balance the set up you have here, however removing it from the shot and a having a more central image with the other two elements would I feel have more visual strengths.<br/> <br/>I like the fact that you have gone for a monotone approach, which means that your image is structured around line and form rather than colour. As a concept this works well, and overall, I feel that you have a good image here. I hope it does well for you</td>', 'The effect with the glass and the vase on the right hand side works really well. I am not sure about the inverted glass on the left. For me compositionally it does not seem to add anything to this shot. I accept that it does balance the set up you have here, however removing it from the shot and a having a more central image with the other two elements would I feel have more visual strengths. I like the fact that you have gone for a monotone approach, which means that your image is structured around line and form rather than colour. As a concept this works well, and overall, I feel that you have a good image here. I hope it does well for you', '2006-04-06 05:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2291398, 315312, 26679, '<td valign="top">I love how you have achieved an impressionist feel to this shot. The simplicity of pastel colours and the deformed lines give a semi surreal feeling which result in a delightful image to look at.<br/> <br/>Compositionally I feel that there is just a little too much of the blue at the bottom of the image. Cropping to half way between the mauve/blue transition, and the bottom would I feel produce a stronger result. <br/> <br/>That being said this is a wonderful image, and completely different in approach and style to the others I have seen to date.  Well done with this great idea.</td>', 'I love how you have achieved an impressionist feel to this shot. The simplicity of pastel colours and the deformed lines give a semi surreal feeling which result in a delightful image to look at. Compositionally I feel that there is just a little too much of the blue at the bottom of the image. Cropping to half way between the mauve/blue transition, and the bottom would I feel produce a stronger result.  That being said this is a wonderful image, and completely different in approach and style to the others I have seen to date.  Well done with this great idea.', '2006-04-06 05:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2291410, 316751, 44611, '<td valign="top">Perfect - ribbon worthy work.  Love the pinks too.</td>', 'Perfect - ribbon worthy work.  Love the pinks too.', '2006-04-06 05:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
