(2291527, 315858, 23251, '<td valign="top">This photo has potential to be very nice.  It appears to be over adjusted on my screen leaving it with a very unnatural look, dcp voters don''t tend to like that so I think you will suffer because of it.  I have not checked but it feels like the image is lower on the right hand side so maybe it needs straightening as well.   Nice choice of shot!</td>', 'This photo has potential to be very nice.  It appears to be over adjusted on my screen leaving it with a very unnatural look, dcp voters don''t tend to like that so I think you will suffer because of it.  I have not checked but it feels like the image is lower on the right hand side so maybe it needs straightening as well.   Nice choice of shot!', '2006-04-06 08:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
