(2291617, 313657, 14614, '<td valign="top">the title and picture go well together, like the oranges/yellows.  the lighting on this one is tricky as your spices need to be a bit lighter but that would blow out even more of your upper left... the writing on the labels can be seen because of the backlighting and that''s a small detraction.</td>', 'the title and picture go well together, like the oranges/yellows.  the lighting on this one is tricky as your spices need to be a bit lighter but that would blow out even more of your upper left... the writing on the labels can be seen because of the backlighting and that''s a small detraction.', '2006-04-06 08:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
