(2291623, 316703, 38032, '<td valign="top">Oh you got me .... that''s briliant.  FAVE 9  .... After looking at all the entries this is the only one that has anything really interesting going on.  It looks like you have a different expression in each square.  It reminds me of pop-art big-time.  Are you familiar with Chuck Close? ... If not look him up.  Anyway, this really works for me in every way.</td>', 'Oh you got me .... that''s briliant.  FAVE 9  .... After looking at all the entries this is the only one that has anything really interesting going on.  It looks like you have a different expression in each square.  It reminds me of pop-art big-time.  Are you familiar with Chuck Close? ... If not look him up.  Anyway, this really works for me in every way.', '2006-04-06 08:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
