(2292334, 314970, 13759, '<td valign="top">This is only sugestion to your next glass picture:<br/>1-Reflections, to easy off then, use a polarizer filter and a 90º light/camera angle.<br/>2-light, always lateral or any combination at 90º from camera.<br/>3-light sources must be softned to prevent hot spots like these. Use a vegetable paper sheet or white cloth to make a tend or simply put it between your light source to filter direct harsh lights.</td>', 'This is only sugestion to your next glass picture:1-Reflections, to easy off then, use a polarizer filter and a 90º light/camera angle.2-light, always lateral or any combination at 90º from camera.3-light sources must be softned to prevent hot spots like these. Use a vegetable paper sheet or white cloth to make a tend or simply put it between your light source to filter direct harsh lights.', '2006-04-06 16:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
