(2292628, 316867, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and clarity.  I like the composition of the background and how it interplays with the glassware.</td>', 'Nice lighting and clarity.  I like the composition of the background and how it interplays with the glassware.', '2006-04-06 19:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
