(2292875, 316312, 51802, '<td valign="top">Good refraction, but the larger bubbles on the right side, and the water on the outside of the glass are distracting. It might be better if it wasn''t cropped so tight at the bottom.</td>', 'Good refraction, but the larger bubbles on the right side, and the water on the outside of the glass are distracting. It might be better if it wasn''t cropped so tight at the bottom.', '2006-04-06 21:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
