(2292963, 316764, 24073, '<td valign="top">Love the idea, and by looking at the thumbnail, I probably would of given a 9, but the  technicals look off.  Dull, and in need of that fine tuning.  Good luck.</td>', 'Love the idea, and by looking at the thumbnail, I probably would of given a 9, but the  technicals look off.  Dull, and in need of that fine tuning.  Good luck.', '2006-04-06 22:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2292969, 315719, 24073, '<td valign="top">Very nice, it gives me a feeling of romance on a Sunday afternoon.  When something catches an emotion like that for me, I always score very well, even if the eye renders a cynical view.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice, it gives me a feeling of romance on a Sunday afternoon.  When something catches an emotion like that for me, I always score very well, even if the eye renders a cynical view.  Good luck.', '2006-04-06 22:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
