(2292990, 314605, 24073, '<td valign="top">For some reason, this is just spooky to me.  Gives me an uneasy feeling.  I don''t score bad for that, quite the opposite really.  If it draws raw emotion from me I normally score well.  Good luck.</td>', 'For some reason, this is just spooky to me.  Gives me an uneasy feeling.  I don''t score bad for that, quite the opposite really.  If it draws raw emotion from me I normally score well.  Good luck.', '2006-04-06 22:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
