(2293003, 316157, 24073, '<td valign="top">Artistic for sure!  A little wierd, yes I think so.  Creepy, in a way.  Visually intriguing, absolutely.  O.K. since so many eyes are watching............9.</td>', 'Artistic for sure!  A little wierd, yes I think so.  Creepy, in a way.  Visually intriguing, absolutely.  O.K. since so many eyes are watching............9.', '2006-04-06 22:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
