(2294751, 316911, 15266, '<td valign="top">Hi Terry!  K - my 2 cents:   First - the scratches on the gazing ball are distracting, but not terribly so.  I love the way you''ve camoflauged the camera!  The simple fact that you thought about how to hide the camera in the shot tells me you are thinking carefully through your set-up which is a very very good thing. The image is tidy (not a lot of distracting items that don''t belong in the image) and the lighting looks very nice.    Outside of the challenge, I would be tempted to PS this shot a bit to clean up the corners and scratches. You''d end with a very nice shot!  :)</td>', 'Hi Terry!  K - my 2 cents:   First - the scratches on the gazing ball are distracting, but not terribly so.  I love the way you''ve camoflauged the camera!  The simple fact that you thought about how to hide the camera in the shot tells me you are thinking carefully through your set-up which is a very very good thing. The image is tidy (not a lot of distracting items that don''t belong in the image) and the lighting looks very nice.    Outside of the challenge, I would be tempted to PS this shot a bit to clean up the corners and scratches. You''d end with a very nice shot!  :)', '2006-04-07 11:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
