(2294930, 316894, 38032, '<td valign="top">I was just reviewing the thumbnails of this contest with the thought that I didn''t have enough  high scores.  Upon looking at the thumbnail i realized what I missed in this one and feel embarassed.  This is a brilliant refraction. My only criticism is the color - it just doesn''t put it into the 9-10 category but overall the image is clever and beautiful and original for this challenge. bumped from 5 to 8</td>', 'I was just reviewing the thumbnails of this contest with the thought that I didn''t have enough  high scores.  Upon looking at the thumbnail i realized what I missed in this one and feel embarassed.  This is a brilliant refraction. My only criticism is the color - it just doesn''t put it into the 9-10 category but overall the image is clever and beautiful and original for this challenge. bumped from 5 to 8', '2006-04-07 12:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
