(2296041, 314370, 41337, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge however the contrast is lacking. Also, I''m not liking the center focus. If you got more of the landscape in the shot that would have probably improved the composition.</td>', 'Meets the challenge however the contrast is lacking. Also, I''m not liking the center focus. If you got more of the landscape in the shot that would have probably improved the composition.', '2006-04-07 19:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
