(2296190, 315404, 51802, '<td valign="top">Great colors, but I don''t think this shows refraction very well.  It is hard to tell if this is a white star with refracted light shining on it, or a multi-colored star.  If the shot were taken from further back, and another item was in the background with the same lighting it would be much more dramatic.</td>', 'Great colors, but I don''t think this shows refraction very well.  It is hard to tell if this is a white star with refracted light shining on it, or a multi-colored star.  If the shot were taken from further back, and another item was in the background with the same lighting it would be much more dramatic.', '2006-04-07 21:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
