(2296912, 314970, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good demonstration of refraction, particularly how the pencil seems to change character completely!  An ironed and/or perhaps more dramatic background would help add a "pop" factor.  The pencils to the side may be a bit superfluous.</td>', 'Good demonstration of refraction, particularly how the pencil seems to change character completely!  An ironed and/or perhaps more dramatic background would help add a "pop" factor.  The pencils to the side may be a bit superfluous.', '2006-04-08 03:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
