(2296915, 316239, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lemme guess - a martini glass in front of a monitor with a sunset photo on it.. :-)  The refraction principle is shown well, though.</td>', 'Lemme guess - a martini glass in front of a monitor with a sunset photo on it.. :-)  The refraction principle is shown well, though.', '2006-04-08 03:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296916, 315731, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very unique approach to the challenge!</td>', 'Very unique approach to the challenge!', '2006-04-08 03:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296917, 316703, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Awesome job!  Really looking forward to seeing how this was accomplished.</td>', 'Wow!  Awesome job!  Really looking forward to seeing how this was accomplished.', '2006-04-08 03:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296918, 316157, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2006-04-08 03:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296920, 316516, 30982, '<td valign="top">The hand kind of spoils this for me, though I see what you''re aiming for based on the title.  Thie prism and the light behind by itself would be very pleasing.</td>', 'The hand kind of spoils this for me, though I see what you''re aiming for based on the title.  Thie prism and the light behind by itself would be very pleasing.', '2006-04-08 03:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296921, 316405, 30982, '<td valign="top">This appears almost as if it were taken through a dirty window.  The sunburst is nice, but overall too bright and nothing seems to be in focus.  A simpler background would help focus attention on your subject.</td>', 'This appears almost as if it were taken through a dirty window.  The sunburst is nice, but overall too bright and nothing seems to be in focus.  A simpler background would help focus attention on your subject.', '2006-04-08 03:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296923, 316622, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not a particularly dramatic demonstration of refraction.  The "hot spots" particularly on the apple itself (vice in the water drops) detract.  DOF is good.</td>', 'Not a particularly dramatic demonstration of refraction.  The "hot spots" particularly on the apple itself (vice in the water drops) detract.  DOF is good.', '2006-04-08 03:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296924, 316363, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, excellent lighting (how do you do that?), and good example of refraction.</td>', 'Lovely colors, excellent lighting (how do you do that?), and good example of refraction.', '2006-04-08 03:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296926, 316728, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice subject choice.</td>', 'Nice subject choice.', '2006-04-08 03:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296930, 316711, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, a ducky.  That said, it''s well exposed and the fishies are cute.</td>', 'Ah, a ducky.  That said, it''s well exposed and the fishies are cute.', '2006-04-08 03:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296932, 315095, 30982, '<td valign="top">Needs a focal point.</td>', 'Needs a focal point.', '2006-04-08 03:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296936, 316344, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2006-04-08 03:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296937, 316908, 30982, '<td valign="top">This strikes me more as reflection rather than refraction.</td>', 'This strikes me more as reflection rather than refraction.', '2006-04-08 03:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296938, 316710, 30982, '<td valign="top">Incredibly rich tones.  Nice approach to the challenge.</td>', 'Incredibly rich tones.  Nice approach to the challenge.', '2006-04-08 03:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296940, 316339, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and would love to know how you avoid reflections.  Good demo of refraction, nice use of a touch of color as well.</td>', 'I like the lighting and would love to know how you avoid reflections.  Good demo of refraction, nice use of a touch of color as well.', '2006-04-08 03:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296944, 316631, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great textures here - nice colors as well.  Something is a wee bit off balance to me - maybe if the topaz were lower in the frame to balance the dark section to the right.</td>', 'Great textures here - nice colors as well.  Something is a wee bit off balance to me - maybe if the topaz were lower in the frame to balance the dark section to the right.', '2006-04-08 03:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296947, 315805, 30982, '<td valign="top">I suspect this might be more effective with a simpler background, though I do like the way the texture shows through in the body of the bird.</td>', 'I suspect this might be more effective with a simpler background, though I do like the way the texture shows through in the body of the bird.', '2006-04-08 03:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296948, 316899, 30982, '<td valign="top">Clever idea!  Like the dislocated finger.</td>', 'Clever idea!  Like the dislocated finger.', '2006-04-08 03:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296949, 316352, 30982, '<td valign="top">Too dark to see what you''re trying to show us.</td>', 'Too dark to see what you''re trying to show us.', '2006-04-08 03:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296953, 316851, 30982, '<td valign="top">The light spots/areas near the top distract, and the area where the light hits on the wall is too bright.</td>', 'The light spots/areas near the top distract, and the area where the light hits on the wall is too bright.', '2006-04-08 03:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296957, 316882, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous textures and tones!  Good job showing refraction as well.</td>', 'Gorgeous textures and tones!  Good job showing refraction as well.', '2006-04-08 03:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296959, 313548, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely effect and gorgeous photo.  I''d almost like to see this with a more delicate bottle to echo the delicate painting behind.</td>', 'Lovely effect and gorgeous photo.  I''d almost like to see this with a more delicate bottle to echo the delicate painting behind.', '2006-04-08 03:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296963, 316814, 30982, '<td valign="top">Depiction of effects of refraction is good; subject matter is a bit weak.  From a compositional standpoint, it''s a bit too centered for my taste.</td>', 'Depiction of effects of refraction is good; subject matter is a bit weak.  From a compositional standpoint, it''s a bit too centered for my taste.', '2006-04-08 03:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296964, 313750, 30982, '<td valign="top">Don''t know exactly what this is or how you did it, but it''s way cool.</td>', 'Don''t know exactly what this is or how you did it, but it''s way cool.', '2006-04-08 03:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
