(2297086, 316849, 50674, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but that''s about it. Maybe if there was something else in the photo, it would become exciting. As it is now, there is a cd and dull background, that''s it.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but that''s about it. Maybe if there was something else in the photo, it would become exciting. As it is now, there is a cd and dull background, that''s it.', '2006-04-08 06:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
