(2303760, 314970, 22748, '<td valign="top">The background needs to be a bit brighter or more uniform. Overall I''d prefer the image to be brighter and the background to have less distracting creases. I recommend putting lights on the background to make it brighter, then either increase the exposure or use the Levels or Curves tool to bump up the brightness, making the background pure white.</td>', 'The background needs to be a bit brighter or more uniform. Overall I''d prefer the image to be brighter and the background to have less distracting creases. I recommend putting lights on the background to make it brighter, then either increase the exposure or use the Levels or Curves tool to bump up the brightness, making the background pure white.', '2006-04-11 14:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303764, 315389, 22748, '<td valign="top">The good: Interesting and simple. The bad: Blurry.</td>', 'The good: Interesting and simple. The bad: Blurry.', '2006-04-11 14:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303767, 316311, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool image. I like the gradient look of the background and the overall simplicty of the image.</td>', 'Cool image. I like the gradient look of the background and the overall simplicty of the image.', '2006-04-11 14:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303770, 316757, 22748, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. The composition is interesting, the only problem is that it seems too blurry overall. Maybe an increased DOF, or focusing on the closest glass would make it feel more intentional.</td>', 'Interesting image. The composition is interesting, the only problem is that it seems too blurry overall. Maybe an increased DOF, or focusing on the closest glass would make it feel more intentional.', '2006-04-11 14:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303772, 316120, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract. Simple. Good.</td>', 'Cool abstract. Simple. Good.', '2006-04-11 14:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303774, 316383, 22748, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!! Fabulous color, pattern, and shape! Really really great!!</td>', 'Gorgeous!! Fabulous color, pattern, and shape! Really really great!!', '2006-04-11 14:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303777, 314235, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice, tight, professional feel. The angle of the shot is compelling, adding interest. Nice and sharp. Good pattern. The only thing missing is more refraction: the thin glasses don''t seem to be exhibiting that much, and since the challenge IS refraction, that is a bit of a reduction in my mind from an otherwise great image.</td>', 'Nice, tight, professional feel. The angle of the shot is compelling, adding interest. Nice and sharp. Good pattern. The only thing missing is more refraction: the thin glasses don''t seem to be exhibiting that much, and since the challenge IS refraction, that is a bit of a reduction in my mind from an otherwise great image.', '2006-04-11 14:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303813, 316383, 30807, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful, clear and well balanced, nice choice of materials in background, lovely colour, very artistic, hot vs cool, contrast of shapes, lines crossing and involved - if you are not in advertising, apply for a job there!<br/> <br/>The best Shot I have seen for refraction of light in all the entries so far<br/> <br/>You have a great future!</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful, clear and well balanced, nice choice of materials in background, lovely colour, very artistic, hot vs cool, contrast of shapes, lines crossing and involved - if you are not in advertising, apply for a job there! The best Shot I have seen for refraction of light in all the entries so far You have a great future!', '2006-04-11 15:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303817, 316849, 30807, '<td valign="top">Captured the rainbow effect quite well, but I suspect you could do more with an adventurous background too, and more darkness/bright contrasting</td>', 'Captured the rainbow effect quite well, but I suspect you could do more with an adventurous background too, and more darkness/bright contrasting', '2006-04-11 15:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303823, 316157, 30807, '<td valign="top">I find this very interesting!  I suspect a pattern of drops, very carefully placed, on a glass slide, and the images in each from the eye-shaped pattern behind. Lovely concept, and so clear that it is a bit hard to see that they are clear drops, instead they mainly look like a collection of minature eyeballs.<br/> <br/>Very effective, and wish you well in the challenge</td>', 'I find this very interesting!  I suspect a pattern of drops, very carefully placed, on a glass slide, and the images in each from the eye-shaped pattern behind. Lovely concept, and so clear that it is a bit hard to see that they are clear drops, instead they mainly look like a collection of minature eyeballs. Very effective, and wish you well in the challenge', '2006-04-11 15:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303826, 316419, 30807, '<td valign="top">Very nice image!<br/> <br/>Wish I had taken it. It looks sort of tweed-like patterns, and a bit like a kalidescope. <br/> <br/>Well done, and good luck!</td>', 'Very nice image! Wish I had taken it. It looks sort of tweed-like patterns, and a bit like a kalidescope.  Well done, and good luck!', '2006-04-11 15:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303830, 315731, 30807, '<td valign="top">What a lovely shot! amazingly good capture of a bubble. <br/> <br/>I am sure it is real, but I never have been able to capture one as good.<br/> <br/>The dark tree behind really makes it stand out, and the colour saturation both in the background and the bubble is excellent<br/> <br/>Hope you do well!</td>', 'What a lovely shot! amazingly good capture of a bubble.  I am sure it is real, but I never have been able to capture one as good. The dark tree behind really makes it stand out, and the colour saturation both in the background and the bubble is excellent Hope you do well!', '2006-04-11 15:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303835, 314606, 30807, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - I think too cold for my personal taste - Maybe with a bit more of a vibrant blue background it would be more zappy?<br/> <br/>I like the light sort of coming down from the top of the picture<br/> <br/>Good luck with the challenge</td>', 'Nice shot - I think too cold for my personal taste - Maybe with a bit more of a vibrant blue background it would be more zappy? I like the light sort of coming down from the top of the picture Good luck with the challenge', '2006-04-11 15:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303851, 316195, 30807, '<td valign="top">Careful placing, lots of thought, nice lighting<br/> <br/>Hope you do well!</td>', 'Careful placing, lots of thought, nice lighting Hope you do well!', '2006-04-11 15:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303852, 316881, 30807, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture, colour well-saturated on the middle bottom bit.<br/> <br/>I think it may be even better on a white background, but maybe the light would not have been strong enough to show well. Better than I have been able to capture, Hope you do well</td>', 'This is a nice picture, colour well-saturated on the middle bottom bit. I think it may be even better on a white background, but maybe the light would not have been strong enough to show well. Better than I have been able to capture, Hope you do well', '2006-04-11 15:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303853, 315907, 30807, '<td valign="top">Nice polarisation shot!<br/> <br/>It looks so crispy and black edged that it almost becomes a graphic art image!<br/> <br/>Very interesting saturated colour <br/> <br/>Hope you do well</td>', 'Nice polarisation shot! It looks so crispy and black edged that it almost becomes a graphic art image! Very interesting saturated colour  Hope you do well', '2006-04-11 15:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303854, 316155, 30807, '<td valign="top">I like the way the moose seems to be set free from the cube - I would never have thought of trying this. Most impressed by the treatment. Good luck</td>', 'I like the way the moose seems to be set free from the cube - I would never have thought of trying this. Most impressed by the treatment. Good luck', '2006-04-11 15:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303857, 316911, 30807, '<td valign="top">I cant tell if its you taking you, or you taking another, or another taking you, but the idea is sound.<br/> <br/>Very hard to get extreme sharpness in this kind of picture, but I like it</td>', 'I cant tell if its you taking you, or you taking another, or another taking you, but the idea is sound. Very hard to get extreme sharpness in this kind of picture, but I like it', '2006-04-11 15:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303862, 314370, 30807, '<td valign="top">I like the refracted light from the sun, and the pearly look to the whole sky around the rainbow created.<br/> <br/>Hope it does well</td>', 'I like the refracted light from the sun, and the pearly look to the whole sky around the rainbow created. Hope it does well', '2006-04-11 15:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303864, 316099, 30807, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - I like the red background, and cant tell if the little pyramid is in the bigger one, or if it is an edit. The colours in it are unexpected Hope you do well with this</td>', 'Nice shot - I like the red background, and cant tell if the little pyramid is in the bigger one, or if it is an edit. The colours in it are unexpected Hope you do well with this', '2006-04-11 15:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303867, 316628, 30807, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in this shot - I think too much red cloth or texture, but like the glass. I would like to see more blue, but think you have a nice shot here<br/> <br/>Hope it does well</td>', 'Nice colors in this shot - I think too much red cloth or texture, but like the glass. I would like to see more blue, but think you have a nice shot here Hope it does well', '2006-04-11 15:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303869, 316889, 41409, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  Great way of showing refraction.  The only suggestion I can offer is to try and get rid of the bubbles in the water.</td>', 'Nice and simple.  Great way of showing refraction.  The only suggestion I can offer is to try and get rid of the bubbles in the water.', '2006-04-11 15:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303873, 315570, 41409, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot and a great idea.  The only thing I can see that''s wrong with it are the reflections in the glasses.  It''s a very hard thing to get rid of but you did a pretty good job.</td>', 'This is a great shot and a great idea.  The only thing I can see that''s wrong with it are the reflections in the glasses.  It''s a very hard thing to get rid of but you did a pretty good job.', '2006-04-11 15:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303874, 314819, 41409, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the only thing I can say that I dislike about this are the bubbles in the bottle.</td>', 'Very nice, the only thing I can say that I dislike about this are the bubbles in the bottle.', '2006-04-11 15:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303876, 316779, 41409, '<td valign="top">Nice work, I like this a lot.</td>', 'Nice work, I like this a lot.', '2006-04-11 15:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303877, 316216, 41409, '<td valign="top">Not sure where the refraction in this is...</td>', 'Not sure where the refraction in this is...', '2006-04-11 15:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303879, 316525, 30807, '<td valign="top">Not bad! Unusual change from the coke advert colouring. The white light seems to enter the liquid in the glass from the top right, and comes out bottom left onto a background. <br/> <br/>And then, the glass is a bit distorted itself, and the rod in it. A nice image, though personally, I feel a bit more varied colour would improve it - but nice shot</td>', 'Not bad! Unusual change from the coke advert colouring. The white light seems to enter the liquid in the glass from the top right, and comes out bottom left onto a background.  And then, the glass is a bit distorted itself, and the rod in it. A nice image, though personally, I feel a bit more varied colour would improve it - but nice shot', '2006-04-11 15:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303880, 316851, 41409, '<td valign="top">This is too dark and the focus is on the soft side.  Maybe try less direct lighting next time?</td>', 'This is too dark and the focus is on the soft side.  Maybe try less direct lighting next time?', '2006-04-11 15:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303882, 315265, 41409, '<td valign="top">Can''t really see what''s going on in this one...but there is some refraction going on.</td>', 'Can''t really see what''s going on in this one...but there is some refraction going on.', '2006-04-11 15:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303885, 315570, 30807, '<td valign="top">I like the way the refracted image of the yellow roses is clearer than anything in the picture - most unusual. I also like the warm lighting, and the colour splash with the velvet I feel a touch of texture in the dark area to the right would enhance this shot.<br/> <br/>Well done, Hope you do well</td>', 'I like the way the refracted image of the yellow roses is clearer than anything in the picture - most unusual. I also like the warm lighting, and the colour splash with the velvet I feel a touch of texture in the dark area to the right would enhance this shot. Well done, Hope you do well', '2006-04-11 15:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303893, 316522, 30807, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. So beautifully sharp and clear outlines of the containers, and an unusual lively blue, with a touch of lilac I cant tell if the colour was there, or if it is a coloured monochrome, but suspect it really was a colour shot. Very ''Advertising'' shot quality. I am sure it will do well. I suspect if you take it again, with even more colours, it could be even more eye-catching, but the way the light has bent the lines of everything behind it shows well in this thoughtfully-composed and lit shot. quite professionally executed!</td>', 'I love this shot. So beautifully sharp and clear outlines of the containers, and an unusual lively blue, with a touch of lilac I cant tell if the colour was there, or if it is a coloured monochrome, but suspect it really was a colour shot. Very ''Advertising'' shot quality. I am sure it will do well. I suspect if you take it again, with even more colours, it could be even more eye-catching, but the way the light has bent the lines of everything behind it shows well in this thoughtfully-composed and lit shot. quite professionally executed!', '2006-04-11 15:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303901, 316710, 30807, '<td valign="top">I live at the seaside, and often photograph on the beach, but this is better than I have been able to shoot. I think it seems to have a touch of sunset about it, and seem to see colour refractions from the light rainbowing the bent rocks under the water - very effective! I think some movement of the ripples has been caught, which drags the image of the rocks and extends them, and you have chosen just the right length of exposure.<br/> <br/>Very nice image on all counts, and just a lovely level of contrast and juxtaposition of sharpnesses<br/> <br/>Hope you do well</td>', 'I live at the seaside, and often photograph on the beach, but this is better than I have been able to shoot. I think it seems to have a touch of sunset about it, and seem to see colour refractions from the light rainbowing the bent rocks under the water - very effective! I think some movement of the ripples has been caught, which drags the image of the rocks and extends them, and you have chosen just the right length of exposure. Very nice image on all counts, and just a lovely level of contrast and juxtaposition of sharpnesses Hope you do well', '2006-04-11 15:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303903, 315672, 55881, '<td valign="top">I thought this is "reflection" instead of "refraction"?</td>', 'I thought this is "reflection" instead of "refraction"?', '2006-04-11 15:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303905, 316044, 55881, '<td valign="top">How is this "refraction"?</td>', 'How is this "refraction"?', '2006-04-11 15:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303907, 315672, 41409, '<td valign="top">This is reflection...</td>', 'This is reflection...', '2006-04-11 15:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303908, 316404, 41409, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, great focus.</td>', 'Nicely done, great focus.', '2006-04-11 15:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303911, 316814, 30807, '<td valign="top">I like the enlargement of the fork, the cherry, and the mandarin slice by the curve of the glass. Nice colour contrast with the background. I somehow feel that there could have been more brightness contrast, but it would perhaps have distracted from the richness of the colour. I think you have judged the balance quite well<br/> <br/>Good luck with the image</td>', 'I like the enlargement of the fork, the cherry, and the mandarin slice by the curve of the glass. Nice colour contrast with the background. I somehow feel that there could have been more brightness contrast, but it would perhaps have distracted from the richness of the colour. I think you have judged the balance quite well Good luck with the image', '2006-04-11 15:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303912, 315958, 41409, '<td valign="top">This is one that really stood out for me, great job with minimizing reflections.</td>', 'This is one that really stood out for me, great job with minimizing reflections.', '2006-04-11 15:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303917, 316796, 30807, '<td valign="top">I am not able to work out what we are looking at here - it seems to be a reflection of trees, inverted, but then the sort of bulls-eye glass ripples indicate not swirls of water, but refraction through glass, and then the colour seems to be added afterward. <br/> <br/>I like the image, but would like it better if I could be sure what I was looking at.<br/> <br/>Good luck with the image</td>', 'I am not able to work out what we are looking at here - it seems to be a reflection of trees, inverted, but then the sort of bulls-eye glass ripples indicate not swirls of water, but refraction through glass, and then the colour seems to be added afterward.  I like the image, but would like it better if I could be sure what I was looking at. Good luck with the image', '2006-04-11 16:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303924, 316766, 30807, '<td valign="top">Surprising refraction in waterjug! I would have expected it too distorted, but it has just reversed the image and somehow intensified the contrast<br/> <br/>I suspect more contrast in the background would be even better, and even if the light was moved so that there was no light reflecting off the surface of the picture you would have an image with a startling result. It has given me the idea to try it myself. I wish you well with the image</td>', 'Surprising refraction in waterjug! I would have expected it too distorted, but it has just reversed the image and somehow intensified the contrast I suspect more contrast in the background would be even better, and even if the light was moved so that there was no light reflecting off the surface of the picture you would have an image with a startling result. It has given me the idea to try it myself. I wish you well with the image', '2006-04-11 16:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303925, 316412, 55881, '<td valign="top">I saw this idea in one of the entry. Seems like this idea is popular. ;)</td>', 'I saw this idea in one of the entry. Seems like this idea is popular. ;)', '2006-04-11 16:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303931, 314604, 30807, '<td valign="top">Gosh! What an intense red, with a rose tinge to it. Most striking colour. <br/> <br/>Personally, I would love to see a touch more detail in the glass and the lettering, but nevertheless, a nice image.<br/> <br/>Good luck with your entry</td>', 'Gosh! What an intense red, with a rose tinge to it. Most striking colour.  Personally, I would love to see a touch more detail in the glass and the lettering, but nevertheless, a nice image. Good luck with your entry', '2006-04-11 16:08:47.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2303932, 314250, 55881, '<td valign="top">How is this a refraction shot??</td>', 'How is this a refraction shot??', '2006-04-11 16:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303934, 316728, 55881, '<td valign="top">8 out of 10 for the creativity!</td>', '8 out of 10 for the creativity!', '2006-04-11 16:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303935, 313548, 55881, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2006-04-11 16:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303936, 316711, 55881, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture! ;)</td>', 'Very nice picture! ;)', '2006-04-11 16:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303940, 316703, 55881, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.. how is it done? 8 out of 10!</td>', 'Nice shot.. how is it done? 8 out of 10!', '2006-04-11 16:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303944, 315404, 30807, '<td valign="top">Now, I like this for all sorts of reasons. I think the choice of colours is very good, the placing of colours along the edges of the stars is cleverly done, it looks like it took ages to achieve. The image is sharp, and well defined.<br/> <br/>I am not certain that it is completly refraction of light, but it''s brilliant lighting. on the bottom middle where the shadow has produced a green line, there is what could perhaps be refraction, though I suspect it is two shadows from two different lights from the edge to the left, rather than a refraction, but the feeling is as of refraction through a prism, and it''s a very nice shot. Well done, hope you do well.</td>', 'Now, I like this for all sorts of reasons. I think the choice of colours is very good, the placing of colours along the edges of the stars is cleverly done, it looks like it took ages to achieve. The image is sharp, and well defined. I am not certain that it is completly refraction of light, but it''s brilliant lighting. on the bottom middle where the shadow has produced a green line, there is what could perhaps be refraction, though I suspect it is two shadows from two different lights from the edge to the left, rather than a refraction, but the feeling is as of refraction through a prism, and it''s a very nice shot. Well done, hope you do well.', '2006-04-11 16:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303945, 313891, 55881, '<td valign="top">Nice pretty shot. Like the mood.. how about an 8? :)</td>', 'Nice pretty shot. Like the mood.. how about an 8? :)', '2006-04-11 16:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303949, 315025, 55881, '<td valign="top">pretty cool shot~!</td>', 'pretty cool shot~!', '2006-04-11 16:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303951, 316239, 55881, '<td valign="top">this is pretty nice.. but it doesn''t really emphasis on refraction...</td>', 'this is pretty nice.. but it doesn''t really emphasis on refraction...', '2006-04-11 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303954, 316732, 30807, '<td valign="top">Nice shot capturing refraction through the glass walls. I wondered if you have used a tungsten lamp and the table or background is white, and therefore the lighting has chosen a daylight setting, so that the gold effect is from the tungsten, or is it that the table is golden, but there is a nice contrast in colour going out from the centred glass. I think that darkening the reflected light in the glass centre, from it''s sort of light lemon to a darker brigh green would add a touch more of green, but it is a lovely shot nevertheless. <br/> <br/>Hope you do well with this</td>', 'Nice shot capturing refraction through the glass walls. I wondered if you have used a tungsten lamp and the table or background is white, and therefore the lighting has chosen a daylight setting, so that the gold effect is from the tungsten, or is it that the table is golden, but there is a nice contrast in colour going out from the centred glass. I think that darkening the reflected light in the glass centre, from it''s sort of light lemon to a darker brigh green would add a touch more of green, but it is a lovely shot nevertheless.  Hope you do well with this', '2006-04-11 16:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303958, 316896, 30807, '<td valign="top">I think this picture speaks for itself. Very nice idea, well executed. The colour fringing shows the distortions in the glass, the refractions of imperfections, the rainbow fringing. Hope you do well with this shot</td>', 'I think this picture speaks for itself. Very nice idea, well executed. The colour fringing shows the distortions in the glass, the refractions of imperfections, the rainbow fringing. Hope you do well with this shot', '2006-04-11 16:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303961, 316153, 30807, '<td valign="top">Nice shot using distortions in the bottome of a glass - well executed and nice lighting. Hope you do well with this shot</td>', 'Nice shot using distortions in the bottome of a glass - well executed and nice lighting. Hope you do well with this shot', '2006-04-11 16:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303968, 316622, 30807, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, well lit, nice selective focus, warm colouring. I like the way that the swelling drops magnify the detailed texturing of the apple skin, and I like the softness of the light contrasted with the brightness of the reflections on the bright area of the apple, and how the rounding of the waterdrops cuts off the reflections. I hope you will not mind if I use this for wallpaper. Best of luck with your image.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, well lit, nice selective focus, warm colouring. I like the way that the swelling drops magnify the detailed texturing of the apple skin, and I like the softness of the light contrasted with the brightness of the reflections on the bright area of the apple, and how the rounding of the waterdrops cuts off the reflections. I hope you will not mind if I use this for wallpaper. Best of luck with your image.', '2006-04-11 16:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303970, 314413, 30807, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit photo of Vodka bottle - can''t quite be certain if the light comes from under the bottle, or down the neck, probably the neck, but what the heck - it''s a very nice image!<br/> <br/>Best of luck with this one!</td>', 'Beautifully lit photo of Vodka bottle - can''t quite be certain if the light comes from under the bottle, or down the neck, probably the neck, but what the heck - it''s a very nice image! Best of luck with this one!', '2006-04-11 16:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303976, 313703, 30807, '<td valign="top">Very inventive use of spotlight, and refractive scatter on background. I like red, so I have a positive reaction immediately. I like also the twinkles on the twisted stem, (caused by refraction within the filter), and there is a rainbowing effect at the edge of the spot caused by refraction from the lens used to focus the white light onto the red background. All well controlled and lit! Nicely photographed, and well done!<br/> <br/>Best of luck with the shot!</td>', 'Very inventive use of spotlight, and refractive scatter on background. I like red, so I have a positive reaction immediately. I like also the twinkles on the twisted stem, (caused by refraction within the filter), and there is a rainbowing effect at the edge of the spot caused by refraction from the lens used to focus the white light onto the red background. All well controlled and lit! Nicely photographed, and well done! Best of luck with the shot!', '2006-04-11 16:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303978, 314393, 55881, '<td valign="top">is that done from basic editing?</td>', 'is that done from basic editing?', '2006-04-11 16:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303984, 313457, 55881, '<td valign="top">That''s more of a relection. no?</td>', 'That''s more of a relection. no?', '2006-04-11 16:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303989, 315140, 55881, '<td valign="top">The theme''s refraction.</td>', 'The theme''s refraction.', '2006-04-11 16:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303993, 315990, 55881, '<td valign="top">Nice creativity..</td>', 'Nice creativity..', '2006-04-11 16:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303995, 316243, 55881, '<td valign="top">wow! i''m pretty interested in how long was the exposure. Nice image!</td>', 'wow! i''m pretty interested in how long was the exposure. Nice image!', '2006-04-11 16:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303997, 314677, 30807, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s a blinder!<br/> <br/>I honestly can''t tell what is happening here! obviously, there is a curved glass surface bending light, but what shape is it?<br/> <br/>And what is the shape like a thorn coming out of the middle and going up to a sort of trumpet-shaped space or assembly? Is it a dark piece of glass, or what?<br/> <br/>And the twisting of the image, and the bending of light apparently within the object - I can''t tell if it some characteristic of the object, or something to do with the background. I suspect it of being a hand-made glass sculpture of some kind, but with the intense red and apparent yellow light showing to the right at the base of the photo, and the purple or violet reflections, and then the white continuatins of those reflections, the only way I could tell would be a 3D photo of the object. The name ''Twisted Light'' is exactly descriptive of the image, and I wish you well with the picture</td>', 'Well, it''s a blinder! I honestly can''t tell what is happening here! obviously, there is a curved glass surface bending light, but what shape is it? And what is the shape like a thorn coming out of the middle and going up to a sort of trumpet-shaped space or assembly? Is it a dark piece of glass, or what? And the twisting of the image, and the bending of light apparently within the object - I can''t tell if it some characteristic of the object, or something to do with the background. I suspect it of being a hand-made glass sculpture of some kind, but with the intense red and apparent yellow light showing to the right at the base of the photo, and the purple or violet reflections, and then the white continuatins of those reflections, the only way I could tell would be a 3D photo of the object. The name ''Twisted Light'' is exactly descriptive of the image, and I wish you well with the picture', '2006-04-11 16:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304003, 316796, 22748, '<td valign="top">I think this is more reflection than refraction.</td>', 'I think this is more reflection than refraction.', '2006-04-11 16:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304004, 316157, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool! Surreal.</td>', 'Cool! Surreal.', '2006-04-11 16:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304006, 316527, 30807, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is a deceptively simple picture, my friend!<br/> <br/>Very careful use of Photoshop, I suspect, what with the ice cubes in the middle glass, the top one very like an island floating on water, with what looks suspiciously like the underside of an iceberg, and no drinks in the other glasses. If they are real glasses, then they must have hugely long stems, as there is no appearance of any glass bases in the shot. I like the warm tones in the refractions and stems, and the cool light and blue sky and sea beyond the island<br/> <br/>I am darned sure it''s not ''real'', but it is very effective - I look forward to finding out how you did this - It''s not clear to me at all<br/> <br/>Good luck with the image</td>', 'Wow! This is a deceptively simple picture, my friend! Very careful use of Photoshop, I suspect, what with the ice cubes in the middle glass, the top one very like an island floating on water, with what looks suspiciously like the underside of an iceberg, and no drinks in the other glasses. If they are real glasses, then they must have hugely long stems, as there is no appearance of any glass bases in the shot. I like the warm tones in the refractions and stems, and the cool light and blue sky and sea beyond the island I am darned sure it''s not ''real'', but it is very effective - I look forward to finding out how you did this - It''s not clear to me at all Good luck with the image', '2006-04-11 16:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304008, 314970, 30807, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what I am looking at here!<br/> <br/>The pencil seems to have changed into some sort of metal item in the bowl, but I am uncertain if it is a knife or fork handle, or what. I think I would like it more if I was more sure of what it reminds me of<br/> <br/>A nice image though, and I wish you luck</td>', 'I am not sure what I am looking at here! The pencil seems to have changed into some sort of metal item in the bowl, but I am uncertain if it is a knife or fork handle, or what. I think I would like it more if I was more sure of what it reminds me of A nice image though, and I wish you luck', '2006-04-11 16:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304011, 313773, 55881, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2006-04-11 16:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304014, 315975, 55881, '<td valign="top">i like the idea of this shot. ;)</td>', 'i like the idea of this shot. ;)', '2006-04-11 16:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304015, 314100, 55881, '<td valign="top">simply beautiful..</td>', 'simply beautiful..', '2006-04-11 16:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304018, 316882, 30807, '<td valign="top">Very nice image!<br/> <br/>Lighting careful, restrained, Ideal contrast, and the separation and reversal caused by the refraction shows very well. I like the silvering of the top glas float a lot, and the subtle shades in the bamboo mat hanging on the wall. <br/> <br/>The image is well balanced, and artistic too<br/> <br/>Hope you do well with this image</td>', 'Very nice image! Lighting careful, restrained, Ideal contrast, and the separation and reversal caused by the refraction shows very well. I like the silvering of the top glas float a lot, and the subtle shades in the bamboo mat hanging on the wall.  The image is well balanced, and artistic too Hope you do well with this image', '2006-04-11 16:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304020, 316869, 22748, '<td valign="top">Like many of the images in this challenge, this is more reflection than refraction, unfortunately.</td>', 'Like many of the images in this challenge, this is more reflection than refraction, unfortunately.', '2006-04-11 16:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
