(2304040, 316893, 30807, '<td valign="top">Unusual image, this!<br/> <br/>I imagine the original scene would show a 3D image in the plate we are looking at, though it is not so obvious in a photograph<br/> <br/>I hope you do well with this, but suspect it is not so clear to many how it demonstrates refraction<br/> <br/>I would love to see a movie of the plate being moved around in the light<br/> <br/>Good luck with your entry</td>', 'Unusual image, this! I imagine the original scene would show a 3D image in the plate we are looking at, though it is not so obvious in a photograph I hope you do well with this, but suspect it is not so clear to many how it demonstrates refraction I would love to see a movie of the plate being moved around in the light Good luck with your entry', '2006-04-11 17:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
