(2304069, 316339, 30807, '<td valign="top">Delightful image!<br/> <br/>Love the pinks, the exaggerated images of fork and spoon here. I cannot imagine that this is really what the camera saw, at least not in one image, anyway, but the spirit of refraction is tremendous!!<br/> <br/>The wonderful graphic greys, the shading, the subtle contrast and shading is lovely to behold. I would love to see this in it''s original size, but as it is, it is a read treat to see<br/> <br/>Best of luck with your inventive entry!</td>', 'Delightful image! Love the pinks, the exaggerated images of fork and spoon here. I cannot imagine that this is really what the camera saw, at least not in one image, anyway, but the spirit of refraction is tremendous!! The wonderful graphic greys, the shading, the subtle contrast and shading is lovely to behold. I would love to see this in it''s original size, but as it is, it is a read treat to see Best of luck with your inventive entry!', '2006-04-11 17:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
