(2304112, 316302, 30807, '<td valign="top">Lovely dewdrops, Like the violet light glowing round the drops!<br/> <br/>My personal feeling is that I would have enhanced the colours more, and used something like the starburst filter to exaggerate the light. <br/> <br/>I didn''t immediately see the sunglasses, but then realised the drops are ''wearing'' a pair each, so I apologise for being a bit slow. It''s the refracted scene inverted from behind the subject which has produced them - an inventive thing to do.<br/> <br/>Wish you well with your entry</td>', 'Lovely dewdrops, Like the violet light glowing round the drops! My personal feeling is that I would have enhanced the colours more, and used something like the starburst filter to exaggerate the light.  I didn''t immediately see the sunglasses, but then realised the drops are ''wearing'' a pair each, so I apologise for being a bit slow. It''s the refracted scene inverted from behind the subject which has produced them - an inventive thing to do. Wish you well with your entry', '2006-04-11 17:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
