(2304183, 316821, 20608, '<td valign="top">Brilliance beyond comprehension. Perfectly OOF to a degree that really gets one annoyed, the size is amazingly acurate and will indeed add greatly to your score, Drive-thru with its rather cute spelling error will add agaiin its own value to making this shot win, without any doubt at all, the BROWN ribbon.<br/> <br/>I hope that is what you are going for because I think you will get it.<br/> <br/>If you really are genuine in your effort then may I offer you this advice. 1-Try getting a shot in focus on SOMETHING. 2- submitting an image that is this small just simply does not work for anyone 3. try using a digital camera and not a mobile phone, they are very handy but take lousy photographs to submit to online photography challenge.  :)</td>', 'Brilliance beyond comprehension. Perfectly OOF to a degree that really gets one annoyed, the size is amazingly acurate and will indeed add greatly to your score, Drive-thru with its rather cute spelling error will add agaiin its own value to making this shot win, without any doubt at all, the BROWN ribbon. I hope that is what you are going for because I think you will get it. If you really are genuine in your effort then may I offer you this advice. 1-Try getting a shot in focus on SOMETHING. 2- submitting an image that is this small just simply does not work for anyone 3. try using a digital camera and not a mobile phone, they are very handy but take lousy photographs to submit to online photography challenge.  :)', '2006-04-11 18:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
