(2305448, 316339, 31133, '<td valign="top">Shail, congratulations on your excellent image! I''d love to know how you did it. The clarity of the glasses (and they''re so clean!) really stand out. I like the color a lot, too. For the "constructive" criticism, I do agree with two commenters below that it would be interesting to see a closer crop and the sharpening was possibly one step too far. The sharpening is most evident with the slight glow around the fork and spoon. But this is really a great image and worthy of a high score! WTG!!</td>', 'Shail, congratulations on your excellent image! I''d love to know how you did it. The clarity of the glasses (and they''re so clean!) really stand out. I like the color a lot, too. For the "constructive" criticism, I do agree with two commenters below that it would be interesting to see a closer crop and the sharpening was possibly one step too far. The sharpening is most evident with the slight glow around the fork and spoon. But this is really a great image and worthy of a high score! WTG!!', '2006-04-12 02:35:08.000000', NULL, 0),
