(2305604, 313703, 21616, '<td valign="top">Thanks so much for voting on this one! I was balancing outside on the lawn &amp; a stubborn ant kept wondering into the frame -- this is one shot he didn''t get into.<br/>The only editing was a crop to get rid of the base of the glass -- I''m not yet technical enough to do fancy stuff. :o)</td>', 'Thanks so much for voting on this one! I was balancing outside on the lawn & a stubborn ant kept wondering into the frame -- this is one shot he didn''t get into.The only editing was a crop to get rid of the base of the glass -- I''m not yet technical enough to do fancy stuff. :o)', '2006-04-12 03:37:38.000000', NULL, 0),
