(2306846, 314393, 22748, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GeckoZ:</b></div><hr/><i> is that done from basic editing? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL! I agree! This image is so clean, it''s unreal.</td>', 'Originally posted by GeckoZ: is that done from basic editing?   LOL! I agree! This image is so clean, it''s unreal.', '2006-04-12 12:56:11.000000', NULL, 0),
