(2306888, 316339, 51538, '<td valign="top">The image design is so clean that the sensor spots and/or dust stand out a mile and detract from the whole effect.  Having said that, I do like the approach and the colour very much.</td>', 'The image design is so clean that the sensor spots and/or dust stand out a mile and detract from the whole effect.  Having said that, I do like the approach and the colour very much.', '2006-04-12 13:11:48.000000', NULL, 0),
