(2306940, 316383, 35357, '<td valign="top">Way to go, Rikki!  You da man!  The designer in you really shines through in this shot.  And damn, dood, your shots are so clean &amp; crisp.  Congrats yet again.  Now stop hogging all the ribbons, it''s becoming quite rude! :-D</td>', 'Way to go, Rikki!  You da man!  The designer in you really shines through in this shot.  And damn, dood, your shots are so clean & crisp.  Congrats yet again.  Now stop hogging all the ribbons, it''s becoming quite rude! :-D', '2006-04-12 13:21:50.000000', NULL, 0),
