(2308959, 316719, 11895, '<td valign="top">This is a very well executed shot that fits the challenge well.  It should have finished much higher.  Colorful with great depth of field.</td>', 'This is a very well executed shot that fits the challenge well.  It should have finished much higher.  Colorful with great depth of field.', '2006-04-13 00:31:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2308962, 316703, 8891, '<td valign="top">Love the distorted images you got. Is it a piece of screening? Great job!</td>', 'Love the distorted images you got. Is it a piece of screening? Great job!', '2006-04-13 00:35:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2308977, 316732, 5112, '<td valign="top">This is really quite beautiful.  Love the greens and brown/golds.  The glass looks so much like it''s being slammed down, almost like it''s making a dent.  I reallly like the pattern on the glass itself, I bet you could make some beautiful macros with that.<br/> <br/>One thing that keeps popping into my mind while looking at this is that it''s so centred.  The light rays are naturally bigger in front, so maybe if the glass was down at a bit higher up and a bit more to one side, maybe even working the angle a bit so that it looks threatening, I don''t know.  Something to play around with.<br/> <br/>The browns/greens are like hazel eyes.<br/> <br/>Pretty good showing too :)</td>', 'This is really quite beautiful.  Love the greens and brown/golds.  The glass looks so much like it''s being slammed down, almost like it''s making a dent.  I reallly like the pattern on the glass itself, I bet you could make some beautiful macros with that. One thing that keeps popping into my mind while looking at this is that it''s so centred.  The light rays are naturally bigger in front, so maybe if the glass was down at a bit higher up and a bit more to one side, maybe even working the angle a bit so that it looks threatening, I don''t know.  Something to play around with. The browns/greens are like hazel eyes. Pretty good showing too :)', '2006-04-13 00:46:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2309149, 316313, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, Karma, congratulations!!!!<br/> <br/>I''m so proud of you :)  Looks like both you and Bernard are putting that Canon to good use.<br/> <br/>Love the combination of swirls and diagonals.</td>', 'Wow, Karma, congratulations!!!! I''m so proud of you :)  Looks like both you and Bernard are putting that Canon to good use. Love the combination of swirls and diagonals.', '2006-04-13 02:13:32.000000', NULL, 0),
