(2309842, 316383, 37961, '<td valign="top">You so fine!</td>', 'You so fine!', '2006-04-13 11:30:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2309926, 316703, 36382, '<td valign="top">Yes it was a piece of screen I found on the side of my house.  It''s not insect screen, but it was to keep out mice.  Each square is about half a centimeter or just less than quarter of an inch.  It is actually silver too although it looks black in the picture.<br/> <br/>Just to tell you that it was one of your images that inspired me to make this picture, so thanks.</td>', 'Yes it was a piece of screen I found on the side of my house.  It''s not insect screen, but it was to keep out mice.  Each square is about half a centimeter or just less than quarter of an inch.  It is actually silver too although it looks black in the picture. Just to tell you that it was one of your images that inspired me to make this picture, so thanks.', '2006-04-13 12:20:38.000000', NULL, 0),
