(2321685, 316195, 38549, '<td valign="top">***Greetings From the Critique Club***<br/> <br/>First off i have to say thank you for entering the challenge, its what keeps this site going.<br/> <br/>Firt off, I like you photograph<br/> <br/>Your composition is well, I like how you didnt center the white and blue sides, like how the corners line up to the opposite colors<br/>what i dont like is the image in the glas, it makes it look likeits not focused, it draws you attetion away from the actually meaning of the photograph<br/>and i just noticed, you did something to the blue, maybe that is the texture of what you used that was blue but its really pixelated like you added to much blue, and in the top corner is almost black, those really draw my attetion away from the actual subject of your photo. <br/> <br/>Over all, you have a great idea, you put a twit on it we havent really seen here yet, <br/>but the blue and the black caused you some votes, <br/> <br/>Keep shooting</td>', '***Greetings From the Critique Club*** First off i have to say thank you for entering the challenge, its what keeps this site going. Firt off, I like you photograph Your composition is well, I like how you didnt center the white and blue sides, like how the corners line up to the opposite colorswhat i dont like is the image in the glas, it makes it look likeits not focused, it draws you attetion away from the actually meaning of the photographand i just noticed, you did something to the blue, maybe that is the texture of what you used that was blue but its really pixelated like you added to much blue, and in the top corner is almost black, those really draw my attetion away from the actual subject of your photo.  Over all, you have a great idea, you put a twit on it we havent really seen here yet, but the blue and the black caused you some votes,  Keep shooting', '2006-04-18 11:56:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2321853, 313657, 38549, '<td valign="top">***Greeting From the Critique club***<br/> <br/>First off i just have to say thankyou for entering the challenge<br/> <br/>when i first see your photo i think cool good subject<br/> <br/>some improvments<br/> <br/>Filter that light its way too bright.<br/>Its really not that sharp, mayb a tripod or siting on something would be good.<br/> <br/>maybe try a different angle, straight on is boring, try brom below or above right and left.<br/> <br/>Sustains.<br/>fill the fram for impact, thats good. <br/> <br/>good ideas,<br/> <br/>and passion for photography, you have the idea just formulat it a little more.</td>', '***Greeting From the Critique club*** First off i just have to say thankyou for entering the challenge when i first see your photo i think cool good subject some improvments Filter that light its way too bright.Its really not that sharp, mayb a tripod or siting on something would be good. maybe try a different angle, straight on is boring, try brom below or above right and left. Sustains.fill the fram for impact, thats good.  good ideas, and passion for photography, you have the idea just formulat it a little more.', '2006-04-18 13:18:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2322068, 314285, 38549, '<td valign="top">***Greetings from the critique club***<br/> <br/>First off i have to say thank you for entering the challenge its what keeps this site going.<br/> <br/>First off i must say i really enjoy your photograph<br/> <br/>this is what i like the most first this really show you took the time and energy to creat a mignificant photo. and your score reflects that. <br/> <br/>I dont really have any negatives, other then i think it would have been nice if you were in focus a litle bit more, but im sure thats easier said then done, i like the background, <br/> <br/>what may have added to your score would have been a colorful shirt say yellow or red, that would be great. <br/> <br/>sustains:<br/>Great ideas, passion for your work, great discription of the photograph, and entering challenges for DPC</td>', '***Greetings from the critique club*** First off i have to say thank you for entering the challenge its what keeps this site going. First off i must say i really enjoy your photograph this is what i like the most first this really show you took the time and energy to creat a mignificant photo. and your score reflects that.  I dont really have any negatives, other then i think it would have been nice if you were in focus a litle bit more, but im sure thats easier said then done, i like the background,  what may have added to your score would have been a colorful shirt say yellow or red, that would be great.  sustains:Great ideas, passion for your work, great discription of the photograph, and entering challenges for DPC', '2006-04-18 14:40:52.000000', NULL, 0),
