(2509733, 314115, 43404, '<td valign="top">I think color would have added more to the effect. You have a great start, the photo is crisp and clean, but the lighting is a little strong at the top.  Even the use of a very simple background- a piece of colored poster board with a desk lamp behind it produces a neat radial effect without a distracting texture.  Good luck!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=282638" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/431/thumb/282638.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/431/thumb/282638.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/431/thumb/282638.jpg"/></a>.</td>', 'I think color would have added more to the effect. You have a great start, the photo is crisp and clean, but the lighting is a little strong at the top.  Even the use of a very simple background- a piece of colored poster board with a desk lamp behind it produces a neat radial effect without a distracting texture.  Good luck!.', '2006-06-12 15:36:06.000000', NULL, 0),
