(2546924, 316710, 16912, '<td valign="top">Coming from my <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=336521&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">1-4-0</a>  thread ...<br/> <br/>Steve, this type of shot isn''t my favourite and it took me a moment to realise quite what it was (I was thinking abstract). IMHO thats a good thing as I spent more time viewing the shot. Looking at the commenters average vote of 7.889 you have a decent market for this type of work.<br/> <br/>If the water was right I''d have preferred the protuding rock to have been in the bottom third of the shot but I guess thats a size of image issue?</td>', 'Coming from my 1-4-0  thread ... Steve, this type of shot isn''t my favourite and it took me a moment to realise quite what it was (I was thinking abstract). IMHO thats a good thing as I spent more time viewing the shot. Looking at the commenters average vote of 7.889 you have a decent market for this type of work. If the water was right I''d have preferred the protuding rock to have been in the bottom third of the shot but I guess thats a size of image issue?', '2006-06-23 22:08:38.000000', NULL, 0),
